// The conversion worker protocol (RFC GO §5.3). Internal: not part of the
// public API, not in the adapters, and served only on the dispatcher's own
// worker endpoint, never on the public gRPC port.
//
// Workers dial the dispatcher; the dispatcher never dials a worker. A worker
// holds one Attach stream per core (its registration and heartbeats) and one
// Work stream per idle slot. A Work stream carries exactly one job and then
// ends; the worker opens a fresh one for its next job.
//
// A job is bytes, a media type, a sanitised name and options. It never carries
// a path, a tenant, a run or a credential.

